   _atom_site_label
   _atom_site_type_symbol
   _atom_site_fract_x
   _atom_site_fract_y
   _atom_site_fract_z
   _atom_site_occupancy
   _atom_site_adp_type
   _atom_site_U_iso_or_equiv
   _atom_site_site_symmetry_multiplicity
Mn1    Mn   0.50000     0.68460     0.25000     1.0000     Uiso 0.0060     2   
W1     W    0.00000     0.18116     0.25000     1.0000     Uiso 0.0040     2   
O1     O    0.2148(11)  0.0974(9)   0.9476(12)  1.0000     Uiso 0.0100     4   
O2     O    0.2513(10)  0.3689(9)   0.3948(12)  1.0000     Uiso 0.0100     4   

